cellUserInfo: cellUserInfoSelectUser_SetList (NID 0x55123A25).

Imported by Into the Nexus 1.01, Full Frontal Assault 1.05 and All 4 One 1.03. (const CellUserInfoListSet* listSet)
configures the user-selection list that a following SelectUser_ListGet/ListSet works on. A NULL listSet is
CELL_USERINFO_ERROR_PARAM; otherwise the (guest) address is kept (ps3_userinfo_list_set()) and CELL_OK returned. With one
user the selection is always that user, so the stored set changes nothing a title can observe (reference: RPCS3).

--- a/libs/system/cellUserInfo.c
+++ b/libs/system/cellUserInfo.c
@@ -125,3 +125,14 @@

     return CELL_OK;
 }
+
+/* ---- patch 7023 ---- */
+static u32 s_userinfo_list_set;
+u32 ps3_userinfo_list_set(void) { return s_userinfo_list_set; }
+
+s32 cellUserInfoSelectUser_SetList(const CellUserInfoListSet* listSet)
+{
+    if (!listSet) return CELL_USERINFO_ERROR_PARAM;
+    s_userinfo_list_set = (u32)(uintptr_t)listSet;   /* guest EA */
+    return CELL_OK;
+}
